      "support": {
        "text": "MakerTube is funded by storage subscriptions. The platform stays ad-free and independent; you pay for the space you use.\n\nPlans (billed monthly via Stripe):\n\n* Free — up to 2 GB\n* 10 GB — €3 / month\n* 100 GB — €5 / month\n* 250 GB — €10 / month\n* 500 GB — €20 / month\n* 1000 GB — €35 / month\n\nSubscribe and manage your plan from your MakerTube account (see <a href=\"/p/ncd-my-subscription\">Storage Plan</a> in menu). Quota updates after a successful payment.\n\nExisting users can already subscribe to a plan according to their usage. Otherwise you will be moved over to the new subscription model later this year.\n\nYou can find your current usage in your account settings: https://makertube.net/my-account\n\nIf you want to tip beyond your plan, optional donations are still welcome:\n\n* Patreon: https://patreon.com/MakerTube\n* Liberapay: https://liberapay.com/MakerTube\n* PayPal: https://paypal.me/MakerTube\n\nQuestions about billing or quota? Email admin[ät]makertube.net."
      },
